==English==
===Etymology===
From {{L.}} ''[[petiolus]]'', little foot, diminuitive form of ''[[pes]].''

===Noun===
'''petiole'''
# (''Botany'') The stalk of a [[leaf]], attaching the [[blade]] to the [[stem]].
# (''Entymology'') A narrow or constricted segment of the body of an [[insect]]. Used especially to refer the metasomal segment of [[Hymenoptera]] such as wasps. Alternate form: [[pedicel]].
# (''Entymology'') The stalk at the base of the nest of the [[paper wasp]].


